@startuml

title Code Deployment / CI Flow

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "GitHub (repo)" as GH
participant "GitHub Actions" as Actions
participant "EDS Build" as EDSBuild
participant "Fastly CDN" as CDN

Dev -> GH : Create branch / PR
GH -> Actions : PR triggers workflow
Actions -> Actions : Run lint / test / build
Actions -> EDSBuild : Push build artifact
EDSBuild -> CDN : Deploy site + invalidate cache
Actions -> GH : Post status (success / failure)
GH -> Dev : Notify build status

note right of Actions
  • lint
  • unit tests
  • visual tests (Playwright)
  • lighthouse CI
end note

@enduml